Package: claudeR
Title: Interact with the Anthropic Claude API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yamil", "Velez", , "yrv2004@columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5355-9950"))
Description: A convenient interface to the Anthropic Claude Messages and Models
    APIs, with support for model discovery, adaptive thinking, streaming,
    structured response metadata, and forward-compatible request parameters.
    Also integrates with the Claude Code command-line interface for agentic
    coding workflows, including file operations, code execution, and multi-turn
    interactions.
